# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Development moved to a Windows machine, where core.autocrlf=true checks every
# text file out as CRLF while the index stays LF. That is invisible until a
# script reads a file as bytes, or a file written on one machine is committed
# from the other. Pinning eol here makes every checkout the same whatever the
# local git config says.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell is read by bash on the runners, and a CR on the end of a line is part
# of the command.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Never touched: a line-ending rewrite inside one of these corrupts it.
